1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 11=

4
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,840
If you insist on this course,

5
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:00,240
then I'll...

6
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:09,590
Father, don't act rashly!

7
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,280
His Highness cares
deeply about the realm.

8
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,760
He would never lose
himself in matters of love.

9
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,560
He only said those things
because he was drunk.

10
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,040
Once sober, he'll know what's at stake.

11
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,510
You've played this part for so long.

12
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:22,640
Do you really think you're

13
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,640
Zhao Boqing's trusted confidant?

14
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:25,680
Princess Yun Fang

15
00:01:26,790 --> 00:01:28,120
is clearly devoted to you.

16
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,920
Why haven't you asked for her hand?

17
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:30,840
The Princess and I...

18
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,790
Have you also let yourself
be blinded by love?

19
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,840
How foolish!

20
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,590
I've paid with my own lifespan

21
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,400
to disrupt the stars,

22
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,230
gain Zhao Boqing's trust,

23
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,840
and force He Xiaoyuan

24
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,280
to become involved
with the Crown Prince.

25
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,480
Who do you think I did all this for?

26
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:50,760
Father...

27
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,480
Father.

28
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:59,400
Zhao Boqing and He Xiaoyuan

29
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:02,350
are the true fated pair.

30
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:04,640
How could I not fear

31
00:02:05,070 --> 00:02:07,040
them growing closer?

32
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:08,870
This thirty-fourth lifetime

33
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:10,960
is our last chance.

34
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:12,800
If anything goes wrong this time,

35
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:15,120
we'll never have
another chance to succeed.

36
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,280
Don't forget,

37
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,800
you and I

38
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,310
are descendants
of the former royal family.

39
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:22,280
Everything I've done

40
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:24,280
has been to pave

41
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:25,430
a clear path

42
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:27,310
for you to reach the very top.

43
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:29,910
I'm sorry.

44
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:32,840
I was wrong.

45
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:36,310
I placed you
by Zhao Boqing's side all these years

46
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,870
because he

47
00:02:38,030 --> 00:02:39,630
is destined to rule.

48
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,470
He is bound to control
the political factions

49
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:43,710
and wield authority
over matters of state.

50
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,840
Only by remaining deeply embedded

51
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:47,520
and earning his complete trust,

52
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,800
only then can you one day

53
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:53,000
seamlessly take over everything he has.

54
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:54,590
I

55
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,630
understand.

56
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:00,960
If you

57
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:03,590
truly understand all I've done for you,

58
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:06,630
then become Princess Yun Fang's
Prince Consort without delay.

59
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,080
Only if Zhao Boqing

60
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:11,520
loses He Xiaoyuan,
his fated companion star,

61
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:13,310
will he be unable
to fully secure the throne.

62
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,560
Then you, as Prince Consort,

63
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,310
can purge the court
of corrupt influences

64
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,400
and overthrow the Crown Prince,

65
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,590
then take control of Great Yue.

66
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,310
Yes.

67
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,870
I

68
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:32,750
will never let

69
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,710
your efforts go to waste.

70
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,150
(Father and son.)

71
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,560
(Descendants
of the former royal family.)

72
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:49,870
(No wonder.)

73
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,120
(Imperial Preceptor,)

74
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,870
(all this time, you and Fu Yang
have spared no effort to assist me,)

75
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:56,240
(and cared more about
my quest for the realm than I did.)

76
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,630
(So He Xiaoyuan and I
are the ones destined for each other.)

77
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:02,470
(So you were behind the chaos
of all thirty-three lifetimes.)

78
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:05,240
(So having your son Fu Yang
eventually ascend the throne)

79
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,750
(was your ultimate goal all along.)

80
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,800
(So this thirty-fourth lifetime)

81
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,710
(was never my last chance.)

82
00:04:10,710 --> 00:04:11,630
(Qingyan Palace)

83
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:12,840
(It was yours.)

84
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,310
Boqing.

85
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:16,390
Fu Yang asked Mother for my hand today.

86
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,870
Mother has agreed.

87
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:18,920
From now on,

88
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,720
your Study Companion is mine.

89
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,120
Boqing,

90
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:31,870
why are you always picking on Fu Yang?

91
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,720
Fu Yang,

92
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,040
that day,

93
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,920
you gave me a gold hairpin as a token.

94
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,480
So this jade pendant

95
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,000
is my gift in return.

96
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,600
From now on,

97
00:04:42,870 --> 00:04:44,800
you may visit
the Princess's Residence often.

98
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,190
Come see me often.

99
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,750
Thank you
for your affection, Your Highness.

100
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:53,750
Yun Fang,

101
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,000
you should head back first.

102
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:56,680
Fu Yang and I still have
important matters to discuss.

103
00:04:58,390 --> 00:04:59,600
All right.

104
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,950
Remember to come see me.

105
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:19,800
Yun Fang truly loves you.

106
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,270
After deceiving her like this,

107
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:23,270
do you really feel no remorse at all?

108
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,040
What do you mean, Your Highness?

109
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,920
Yes. I will never let

110
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,270
Father's efforts go to waste.

111
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,830
Only if Zhao Boqing loses

112
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:39,750
He Xiaoyuan, his fated companion star,

113
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,120
will he be unable
to fully secure the throne.

114
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,000
Then you, as Prince Consort,

115
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:44,630
can purge the court of corrupt influences
and overthrow the Crown Prince,

116
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,270
then take control of Great Yue.

117
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:47,310
You plotted against me.

118
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,510
Fu Yang,

119
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,680
who has really
been plotting against whom?

120
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:54,190
You and your father have kept

121
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:55,630
your relationship
and identities deeply hidden.

122
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,310
I've schemed and struggled
through thirty-three lifetimes.

123
00:05:57,310 --> 00:05:58,240
I never imagined

124
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:00,720
my greatest enemy

125
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:02,310
was right beside me.

126
00:06:02,390 --> 00:06:03,190
As expected.

127
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:06,270
Someone as clear-headed
and resilient as Your Highness

128
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:07,510
would never get drunk for no reason.

129
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:11,630
I've lost.

130
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:14,680
Your Highness,

131
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:16,000
I failed in my duty.

132
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,600
The Imperial Preceptor
has fled the Observatory.

133
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,240
Where did he go?

134
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:22,830
Tell me.

135
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:23,870
Your Highness,

136
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:26,510
what you should be
more concerned about right now

137
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,510
is He Xiaoyuan's safety.

138
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,510
Now that my father has fled,

139
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,510
his next move

140
00:06:32,310 --> 00:06:34,190
will surely be to destroy
your path to the throne.

141
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:35,480
Do you think

142
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,070
he'll spare your companion star?

143
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,430
Xiaoyuan!

144
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,240
Xiaoyuan!

145
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:18,680
Are you all right?

146
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:23,100
(One hour earlier)

147
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:23,870
Drink slowly.

148
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,390
Zhao Junyao

149
00:07:26,390 --> 00:07:27,800
is a kind but weak Crown Prince,

150
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:28,870
unfit to rule.

151
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:31,270
It's only a matter
of time before the realm falls.

152
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,000
But

153
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:34,430
he is innocent too.

154
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,430
In this lifetime,

155
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:36,870
I won't kill him.

156
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:38,720
Such defiance of fate.

157
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,630
Xiaoyuan,

158
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,190
you...

159
00:07:40,630 --> 00:07:42,480
What exactly
have you gotten yourself into?

160
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,360
Xiaoyuan,

161
00:07:43,830 --> 00:07:45,360
isn't Daniu an escort?

162
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:46,750
What does he really do?

163
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:48,070
Let me explain.

164
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:49,600
The Seventh Prince has ordered

165
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,680
everyone but He Xiaoyuan

166
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,360
to be killed.

167
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:51,830
Who are you?

168
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:52,360
What are you doing?

169
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,170
- Who are you?
- What are you doing?

170
00:07:53,170 --> 00:07:53,630
Xiaoyuan!

171
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,600
What are you doing?

172
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,070
Xiaoyuan!

173
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:55,950
Let them go!

174
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:57,190
- Let them go!
- Let go of me!

175
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:58,830
Help!

176
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:00,310
Other than you, who still has value,

177
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,920
no one

178
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,870
can be allowed to threaten
His Highness's path to the throne.

179
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,510
That includes

180
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:09,750
your parents and family.

181
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,560
Burn this place down.

182
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:20,630
They're gone.

183
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,390
Father...

184
00:08:24,070 --> 00:08:24,830
Mother...

185
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:29,120
And my sister...

186
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:31,830
They're all gone.

187
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,000
Why?

188
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,240
Xiaoyuan.

189
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:47,720
Fu Yang said

190
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:54,000
nothing can jeopardize
your path to the throne.

191
00:08:59,630 --> 00:09:00,510
So...

192
00:09:09,390 --> 00:09:10,200
So

193
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,720
my family, who accidentally
learned your secret,

194
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,000
had to die.

195
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,080
But I don't believe him.

196
00:09:19,270 --> 00:09:20,600
That's why I'm waiting here for you

197
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,870
to tell me the truth yourself.

198
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,080
Xiaoyuan,

199
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:26,510
believe me.

200
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,720
I never gave such an order.

201
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,320
Fu Yang has betrayed me.

202
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:32,080
It's dangerous here now.

203
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,270
Let me take you back first.

204
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,870
I promise I'll give you an explanation.

205
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,870
Let's go.

206
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,720
Whether you did it or not,

207
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,720
I'm not going with you.

208
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:43,440
Why?

209
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,600
Just come with me first.

210
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,080
Zhao Boqing!

211
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:53,080
My father, mother,
and sister are already dead.

212
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:55,270
What difference
would an explanation make now?

213
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:55,840
I...

214
00:09:58,030 --> 00:09:58,910
It's my fault.

215
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:01,910
I shouldn't have gotten close to you,

216
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:05,080
nor should I have become
involved in your grand ambitions.

217
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,870
All I ever wanted

218
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:16,000
was for them to get
the treatment they needed

219
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,550
and live out their lives in peace.

220
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,270
Why, in the end,

221
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,870
did I still bring this upon them?

222
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,840
Xiaoyuan.

223
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:28,960
It's all my fault.

224
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,910
Xiaoyuan.

225
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:38,630
Xiaoyuan, don't be afraid.

226
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:39,670
I'm here.

227
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,440
What's going on?

228
00:10:44,630 --> 00:10:45,440
Boqing,

229
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,670
are you really involved in this?

230
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,720
Why is the Crown Prince here?

231
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:53,270
Xiaoyuan sent me a message
by carrier pigeon

232
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,510
telling me where she was.

233
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:58,580
(Written by He Xiaoyuan in tears)

234
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:02,240
(What's going on?)

235
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,390
Xiaoyuan.

236
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:26,910
Give these people a proper burial.

237
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:28,360
Yes.

238
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:50,280
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

239
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:52,320
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

240
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:55,960
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

241
00:11:56,480 --> 00:12:00,800
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

242
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:03,560
♪My heart has long known♪

243
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,000
♪We made a promise long ago♪

244
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,920
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

245
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:11,920
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

246
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:15,080
♪How much must I let go♪

247
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,080
♪For one moment♪

248
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:20,080
♪To hold each other close♪

249
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:24,640
♪Would that be enough?♪
